    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "You can set this property to [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true) for a video connection if [`isCameraIntrinsicMatrixDeliverySupported`](avcaptureconnection/iscameraintrinsicmatrixdeliverysupported.md) is [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true), and only before calling the [`AVCaptureSession`](avcapturesession.md) [`startRunning()`](avcapturesession/startrunning().md) method.",
      "normalizedSource": "You can set this property to [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true) for a video connection if [`isCameraIntrinsicMatrixDeliverySupported`](avcaptureconnection/iscameraintrinsicmatrixdeliverysupported.md) is [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true), and only before calling the [`AVCaptureSession`](avcapturesession.md) [`startRunning()`](avcapturesession/startrunning().md) method.",
      "sourceHash": "b417a1db8ea58b4fb28c8ae4c98821c3e43d69e805250cd944c5fe370bca3a3f",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "The default value is [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false).",
      "documentTitle": "isCameraIntrinsicMatrixDeliveryEnabled",
      "framework": "AVFoundation",
      "ko": "이 속성은 [`isCameraIntrinsicMatrixDeliverySupported`](avcaptureconnection/iscameraintrinsicmatrixdeliverysupported.md)가 [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true)일 때 비디오 연결에 대해 [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true)로 설정할 수 있으며, [`AVCaptureSession`](avcapturesession.md) [`startRunning()`](avcapturesession/startrunning().md) 메서드를 호출하기 전에서만 가능합니다.",
      "status": "machine_translated",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false,
      "translatedAt": "2026-05-12T15:21:32.139Z",
      "translator": "codex-cli-oauth"
